/P 271 0 R
/T (CU receives ADD R1, X; CU computes the starting address of the corresponding microprogram in CM i.e. P from the opcode of this instruction, executes all the microinstructions in sequence from address P. The execution of 7 microinstructions activates 7 sets of control signals to execute 7 micro operations)
/E (CU receives ADD R1, X; CU computes the starting address of the corresponding microprogram in CM i.e. P from the opcode of this instruction, executes all the microinstructions in sequence from address P. The execution of 7 microinstructions activates 7 sets of control signals to execute 7 micro operations)
